`whisper-large-v3-turbo`, `whisper-medium-q5_0`, and `whisper-large-v3-turbo-q5_0`.
Source tree: https://huggingface.co/ggerganov/whisper.cpp

### Moonshine Streaming Small ONNX INT8

MIT License. The source model is Useful Sensors' English-only
`moonshine-streaming-small`: https://huggingface.co/UsefulSensors/moonshine-streaming-small
The pinned ONNX INT8 export is from Mazino0 at revision
`d47300364351d5dd673073c16f0159b5ee46f512`:
https://huggingface.co/Mazino0/moonshine-streaming-small-onnx
