### Rumble-2-Flash GGUF Q8_0

Apache License 2.0. Rumble-2-Flash by Reson8, fine-tuned from the Qwen3-ASR
0.6B base model (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-0.6B). Source:
